# Secrets and environment-specific values (see docs/conventions.md,
# docs/secrets.md). Two committed, non-secret counterparts are exempted:
# .env.example (placeholder values, documents shape) and secrets.enc.env
# (real values, sops+age ciphertext — safe to commit because it's encrypted).
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
!*.enc.env

.DS_Store
